nt":3},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1}],"text":[{"business_id":"3NgkGlI1QrEc-5g8zvVpKQ","review_id":"WnGK6vZ3ZygcHkTSeBgZiA","date":"2014-02-15T20:24:22","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9453592300415039,"text_excerpt":"Honestly, I was pretty nervous about trying this place out because of the low star rating. However, I took a chance today since I was out shopping and starving! It was great! The burger and fries and food were really good. Atmosphere is fun and inviting. I sat downstairs where it is counter service and people watched through the big windows. My only small gripe is that it is a little pricey. I had a standard burger and fries and a draft beer and the total was $18. I did like it enough to go back but of you're on a budget, you may want to try elsewhere."},{"business_id":"3NgkGlI1QrEc-5g8zvVpKQ","review_id":"kFYnGE8j93Q9WswArdjiaQ","date":"2014-03-07T02:40:19","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9432061314582825,"text_excerpt":"I really like this place. I'm a burger fanatic so I'm always down for one. Love the buns and all the burger options. I'm pretty basic with my choices but I may get adventurous on another trip. My burger was cooked perfectly, well-seasoned and juicy! Toppings were all fresh which is HUGE with me and the fries were yummy! I'm a fan! Great service too. The staff was very attentive and asked how everything was a few minutes after we started eating (we were downstairs in the casual/quick/take-out section), even got our tea refills for us. Granted it wasn't very crowded, but we appreciated the service."},{"business_id":"3NgkGlI1QrEc-5g8zvVpKQ","review_id":"8j5fr9dCbUZk99y8JawdlA","date":"2013-08-30T07:22:52","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9418113827705383,"text_excerpt":"Went for the first time with a friend (second time) there. Ordered the Piggy Back Shrimp which we enjoyed, very crisp bacon which was perfect. However, portion size is like fine dining, 4 to an order and $12 is a little steep. We both decided to Build Our Own Burger option. I order the Akaushi-Kobe (medium rare) on Brioche Bun (loved the bun) with Aged Goat Cheese, Lettuce, Caramelized Onions which was delicious!!! My friend also ordered the Akaushi-Kobe (well done) with Cheddar Cheese, Caramelized Onions, which was also delicious. We also ordered one order of fries to split which are served in basket and enough to share. They are hand cut, fried and have sprinkle kosher salt on them. Yum..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"3NgkGlI1QrEc-5g8zvVpKQ","photo_id":"wvFAvJIz-6s8f824ORgzFw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/wvFAvJIz-6s8f824ORgzFw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8741991519927979},{"business_id":"3NgkGlI1QrEc-5g8zvVpKQ","photo_id":"HzNSoYZNyMcAN6X6TvDDSQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/HzNSoYZNyMcAN6X6TvDDSQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.855926513671875},{"business_id":"3NgkGlI1QrEc-5g8zvVpKQ","photo_id":"gl6wcqxgmi7kU1eRLbJTFw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/gl6wcqxgmi7kU1eRLbJTFw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8538417816162109},{"business_id":"3NgkGlI1QrEc-5g8zvVpKQ","photo_id":"hdJ5aEu2ABCZjx5Ofwi4yg","label":"inside","image_url":"/